468 0 obj
<<
/Title (As the organisation grows, requirements become more demanding. Large numbers of participants and events raise performance and data-management concerns; integration with payment, CRM and inventory systems raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of personal data raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as attendance forecasting need external services. In such cases extensions, integrations or custom development are needed in addition to the low-code application. Low-code is therefore useful for rapidly developing standard business applications, whereas increasingly complex enterprise requirements call for a hybrid approach, and the choice should be based on the requirements of the application.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 358 0 R
/Prev 530 0 R
>>
endobj
